This  driver  supports  HIL  keyboards  within the framework.  It
doesn’t provide direct device driver entry points, but makes  its
functions  available  through the internal interface.  The driver
supports a number of different key  mappings.   By  default,  the
layout  corresponding to the keyboard model as probed by the dri‐
ver will be used.  A different layout can be chosen  either  with
the kernel option at compile time, or with the utility (variable:
at  runtime.  The supported key mappings are at this time: German
with French with Swedish.  British.  English/US keyboard mapping.
